WEBVTT

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:08.436
Right, today's race: one coffee to the table. Rules? There are none.

00:00:11.673 --> 00:00:18.343
First place, the airplane team, obviously. Only, that meter is my meter.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:26.026
The airplane team's coffee, arrived! The invoice arrives with it, naturally.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:31.039
I skipped the meter and did one lap on foot instead.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:39.475
First place: one coffee. Second place: one invoice. Next round? We run it inside our own building.

